<#assign cs><@printParam block "#CotSymbol#" /></#assign>((SqCOTScore(${cotSymbolInput(cs)}, <@printCIShift block shift />) - SqCOTScore(${cotSymbolInput(cs)}, SqCOTWeeksAgo(<@printCIShift block shift />, <@printParam block "#MomPeriod#" />))) < 0 && (SqCOTScore(${cotSymbolInput(cs)}, SqCOTWeeksAgo(<@printCIShift block shift />, 1)) - SqCOTScore(${cotSymbolInput(cs)}, SqCOTWeeksAgo(<@printCIShift block shift />, 1 + <@printParam block "#MomPeriod#" />))) >= 0)